Third-party components
----------------------
KiteCodec links against FFmpeg's libav* libraries (https://ffmpeg.org),
licensed under the LGPL-2.1-or-later (or the GPL when built with
--enable-gpl; KiteCodec's GPL build flavour is effectively GPL-3.0, as it
also sets --enable-version3). FFmpeg is NOT covered by this NOTICE or by
KiteCodec's Apache-2.0 license.

Depending on the build flavour, the linked FFmpeg additionally bundles
third-party codec and rendering libraries (SVT-AV1, libvpx, libaom, libopus,
libmp3lame, libwebp, FreeType, HarfBuzz, FriBidi, libass, x264/x265 in the
GPL flavour, and others), each under its own license.

The complete component list, per-component licenses, and the distribution
obligations they carry are documented at:
https://yuroyami.github.io/KiteCodec/licensing/
(source: docs/licensing.md in this repository).
